OL,5,G1300 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FIn central Derbyshire, the Traffic
OL,7,     FCops are on the hunt for a car
OL,8,     Flinked to the theft of two
OL,9,     Fmotorbikes. After a 10-minute
OL,10,     Fsearch, officers spot the car.
OL,11,G1400 Police Interceptors
OL,12,     FArmed police respond to reports of
OL,13,     Fa fight involving machetes. Plus,
OL,14,     Fcops provide a dawn chorus (aka
OL,15,     Fraid).
OL,16,G1500 Police Interceptors
OL,17,     FPolice enter a 'house of horrors'
OL,18,     Fseeking a man on the run. Plus, an
OL,19,     Fepic 45-mile pursuit.
