OL,5,G1600 Police Interceptors
OL,6,     FDoors get smashed in dawn raids on
OL,7,     Fdrug dealers, shots are fired in a
OL,8,     Fsuburban siege, and bad guys are
OL,9,     Fchased at more than 100mph.
OL,10,G1700 Rogue Claimers
OL,11,     FAn armed robbery abroad leaves one
OL,12,     Fclaimant massively out of pocket,
OL,13,     Fbut the police report tells a
OL,14,     Fcompletely different story.
OL,15,     FMeanwhile, dash cam footage
OL,16,     Fexposes a bogus accident.
OL,17,G1800 Home and Away
OL,18,     FSummer Bay is rocked by a shocking
OL,19,     Fact of vandalism. Mackenzie and
OL,20,     FLevi face a tough decision.
OL,21,     FMarilyn makes an impassioned plea.
