OL,5,G2100 Ambulance: Code Red
OL,6,     FA man suffering a suspected
OL,7,     Fcardiac arrest collapses at the
OL,8,     Fwheel, crashing his car. And a
OL,9,     Fholiday ends abruptly when a man
OL,10,     Ftumbles out of the hot tub in a
OL,11,     Fremote log cabin.
OL,12,G2200 A&E After Dark
